WEBVTT

00:00:03.140 --> 00:00:06.390
People of the proud kingdom of Re-Estize!

00:00:06.860 --> 00:00:08.980
These devils are not deserving of our fear!

00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:12.740
My sword and shield shall be with you!

00:00:15.110 --> 00:00:18.620
Long live Prince Zanac!

00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:28.670
Where did all the citizens go?
Are they hiding inside their houses?

00:00:28.670 --> 00:00:33.380
The doors have been broken down.
They were probably taken somewhere else.

00:00:33.590 --> 00:00:37.510
Iron and copper adventurers,
stay here and search through the houses!

00:00:37.510 --> 00:00:41.140
The rest of you spread out and form a line.

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:46.010
Here they come.

00:00:49.690 --> 00:00:54.950
An Overeating, Gazer Devils,
and 15 Hellhounds...!

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:01.980
Hey, don't run away!

00:01:18.010 --> 00:01:18.840
Toss me!

00:01:30.060 --> 00:01:33.370
That just leaves
the Gazer Devils and Overeating!

00:01:44.120 --> 00:01:45.660
Such paltry opponents.

00:01:47.330 --> 00:01:50.630
I, Momon the adventurer,

00:01:50.630 --> 00:01:53.390
will now go and take down
the enemy leader, Jaldabaoth!

00:01:56.260 --> 00:02:00.550
In the meantime, keep the citizens
who are beyond the wall safe.

00:02:01.350 --> 00:02:02.310
I'm counting on you.

00:02:10.900 --> 00:02:12.110
It's started.

00:02:12.110 --> 00:02:14.900
Yes. We have to find
the people taken prisoner now,

00:02:15.160 --> 00:02:17.070
while the demons are distracted.

00:02:17.070 --> 00:02:19.860
Yeah. According to
the princess's conjecture,

00:02:19.860 --> 00:02:21.990
the warehouses in this area
are likely candidates.

00:02:30.920 --> 00:02:34.160
Shalltear... Bloodfallen...

00:02:37.920 --> 00:02:42.010
Climb, I'll buy us some time.
You go on ahead.

00:02:49.690 --> 00:02:52.270
What are you all doing in the capital?

00:02:52.900 --> 00:02:56.530
Why should I have to be asked that by you?

00:02:57.530 --> 00:03:00.480
Are you the only one who made it in this far?

00:03:01.360 --> 00:03:05.280
Were you looking for someone else?
Someone not me?

00:03:06.040 --> 00:03:09.040
You? Why would I?

00:03:11.330 --> 00:03:15.200
She's saying it's hard to remember
someone as insignificant as an ant?

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:20.220
Would you rather I kill you?
Would you like to die?

00:03:20.220 --> 00:03:25.550
If you bow down to me and lick my boots,
it may improve my mood.

00:03:26.060 --> 00:03:28.680
Sorry, but I'm not inclined to do that.

00:03:28.930 --> 00:03:30.980
Martial Art! Field!

00:03:35.110 --> 00:03:39.280
Not being aware of the difference
between our abilities is a real hassle.

00:03:40.610 --> 00:03:41.740
Oh, I <i>am</i> aware.

00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:46.240
Still, I can at least buy some time.

00:03:49.120 --> 00:03:51.160
Wielding my sword...

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:53.420
is my life.

00:03:56.670 --> 00:03:58.670
I may have fallen behind, but thank you...

00:04:00.010 --> 00:04:01.300
...my friends.

00:04:08.390 --> 00:04:10.600
Four Fold Slash of Light.

00:04:15.100 --> 00:04:15.750
Huh?

00:04:16.530 --> 00:04:17.480
You were aiming for it...?

00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:23.740
It looks like you pass as a nail clipper.

00:04:25.070 --> 00:04:27.630
You have my gratitude for the compliment.

00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:32.500
My swordsmanship--
My life has not been for nothing!

00:04:33.330 --> 00:04:37.000
I've reached an unreachable height,
if only in small part!

00:04:37.420 --> 00:04:40.370
You sound like you have
a screw loose somewhere.

00:04:44.170 --> 00:04:49.100
Even with the One so close by,
thanks to his detection-blocking ring,

00:04:49.100 --> 00:04:51.560
I can't even sense his presence.

00:04:55.140 --> 00:05:00.070
There's no way a human weakling
is getting away from me unharmed!

00:05:00.070 --> 00:05:01.690
Time Accelerator!

00:05:05.700 --> 00:05:06.540
Is that...?

00:05:14.120 --> 00:05:16.000
You are indeed strong.

00:05:27.300 --> 00:05:30.350
We must have underestimated
Jaldabaoth's forces.

00:05:30.350 --> 00:05:32.300
I'll let you two take those five.

00:05:32.890 --> 00:05:35.350
Let's get to it, Demiu-- Demon!

00:05:38.900 --> 00:05:43.090
I will take three if you will take two,
is that all right?

00:05:43.610 --> 00:05:45.490
I don't mind taking three.

00:05:46.950 --> 00:05:49.740
You take two, and I'll take three.

00:05:50.990 --> 00:05:52.490
You're a stubborn one.

00:05:53.080 --> 00:05:55.520
I'll let you all decide who will fight me.

00:05:57.960 --> 00:06:01.750
My name is Alpha. This here is Delta.

00:06:02.170 --> 00:06:04.750
Is that so? You sure are courteous.

00:06:05.510 --> 00:06:07.010
My name is Evileye.

00:06:07.470 --> 00:06:09.820
I am the one who will defeat you!

00:06:14.060 --> 00:06:16.980
What are you doing here?
I told you to go on ahead!

00:06:16.980 --> 00:06:18.440
W-Well, we...

00:06:18.440 --> 00:06:21.810
Hold on, hold on, hold on, hold on.
I don't know what just happened,

00:06:21.810 --> 00:06:24.100
but there has to be more to it
than what you said.

00:06:25.480 --> 00:06:27.440
Why isn't she coming after me?

00:06:27.440 --> 00:06:29.280
What exactly did you do?

00:06:29.280 --> 00:06:32.030
I found the monster
who can stack up against Mr. Sebas.

00:06:32.990 --> 00:06:33.780
And...?

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:39.080
I took my sword and...
Yeah, I cut her fingernail with it!

00:06:39.370 --> 00:06:42.580
I cut off her fingernail!

00:06:42.920 --> 00:06:48.260
Y-Yeah, so you cut her nail
with your sword. Sure, that is amazing.

00:06:48.260 --> 00:06:51.400
Yes, I think... that's amazing...

00:06:54.930 --> 00:06:58.570
In any case, it's a miracle
nobody is coming after us. Let's hurry.

00:06:59.600 --> 00:07:03.410
Martial Art! Dark Blade Mega Impact!

00:07:08.280 --> 00:07:10.860
Floating Swords!

00:07:15.030 --> 00:07:16.790
They just keep coming.

00:07:16.790 --> 00:07:18.120
What do we do, fiendish boss?

00:07:19.620 --> 00:07:23.130
This is bad. The priests
are almost out of magic power.

00:07:27.250 --> 00:07:29.010
Six Fold Slash of Light!

00:07:32.680 --> 00:07:33.960
Finish them!

00:07:36.680 --> 00:07:40.020
Why is Lord Stronoff here when he's
supposed to be guarding the castle?

00:07:42.850 --> 00:07:44.100
--His Majesty?!
--King Ramposa III?!

00:07:44.100 --> 00:07:45.690
What is he doing here?!

00:07:46.480 --> 00:07:47.940
His Majesty says...

00:07:48.610 --> 00:07:52.880
"Is it the castle that you protect, or is it me?"

00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:55.200
There is only one answer!

00:07:55.730 --> 00:07:58.650
It is our role to protect the king!

00:07:59.240 --> 00:08:02.460
As such, here is where we must fight!

00:08:02.870 --> 00:08:04.300
Charge through!

00:08:06.170 --> 00:08:09.300
Lord Stronoff, I need your help, please.

00:08:09.300 --> 00:08:10.300
Of course.

00:08:10.380 --> 00:08:11.770
Hold on a second!

00:08:12.930 --> 00:08:16.220
Could you use the support
of a once-outstanding warrior?

00:08:16.220 --> 00:08:19.220
There's a future
outstanding ninja here, too.

00:08:19.430 --> 00:08:21.230
Gagaran! Tia!

00:08:21.640 --> 00:08:24.440
Just lying around was making me soft.

00:08:24.440 --> 00:08:25.690
We're ready to fight.

00:08:25.690 --> 00:08:26.480
There's no way you can...

00:08:28.900 --> 00:08:30.710
That's reassuring to hear!

00:08:38.580 --> 00:08:39.560
Let's go!

00:08:40.290 --> 00:08:40.990
Yeah!

00:08:43.710 --> 00:08:45.620
Shard Buckshot!

00:08:48.670 --> 00:08:49.880
Not again!

00:08:51.340 --> 00:08:51.800
Ha!

00:08:52.840 --> 00:08:53.760
Tch!

00:08:56.510 --> 00:08:59.180
I'll cover you. Not that you need it.

00:09:07.600 --> 00:09:09.230
Sand Field All!

00:09:13.030 --> 00:09:18.030
Damn, it's not right for monsters to be
teaming up and reinforcing each other!

00:09:19.280 --> 00:09:20.290
What the--?!

00:09:24.250 --> 00:09:25.610
Crystal Wall!

00:09:33.510 --> 00:09:34.340
<i>Fa jin</i>?!

00:09:36.760 --> 00:09:40.550
I should commend you. Immobilization
and negative energy don't work on you.

00:09:41.140 --> 00:09:43.150
You've got every resistance there is, huh?

00:09:46.060 --> 00:09:48.060
They're still fighting over there.

00:09:50.980 --> 00:09:53.760
In that case, I'm just going to
have to buy a little more time!

00:10:10.170 --> 00:10:12.260
This room is secure, right?

00:10:12.590 --> 00:10:14.170
Everything is fine.

00:10:14.800 --> 00:10:18.220
There is no one who can listen in
on our conversation in here.

00:10:19.010 --> 00:10:23.720
No one, huh? All right,
tell me the entirety of your plan.

00:10:24.930 --> 00:10:29.350
First, allow me to thank you
very much for indulging me

00:10:29.350 --> 00:10:32.860
when I said that I would like
to meet with you, Lord Ains.

00:10:32.860 --> 00:10:33.480
Mm-hmm.

00:10:34.110 --> 00:10:37.990
There are four merits
to the series of plans I have made.

00:10:38.240 --> 00:10:40.560
Four?! I don't know a single one of them!

00:10:41.280 --> 00:10:43.740
Ho, I thought it was three.

00:10:43.950 --> 00:10:47.470
I think this may be the first time
that I have bested you in a contest of wits.

00:10:47.910 --> 00:10:50.580
Oh, you always have the better of me.

00:10:50.580 --> 00:10:53.500
How can you say such a thing?
You are too modest.

00:10:53.590 --> 00:10:55.630
No, really. Ahem...

00:10:56.090 --> 00:10:59.510
Now, why don't you tell me
about these four merits?

00:10:59.760 --> 00:11:02.090
Yes, my lord. The first one

00:11:02.090 --> 00:11:04.930
is that we are claiming all of the materials
that are in these storehouses.

00:11:04.930 --> 00:11:05.600
Mm-hmm.

00:11:06.430 --> 00:11:10.770
Fantastic! Now we won't have to worry
about being low on funds for a while.

00:11:10.770 --> 00:11:13.270
Second, it allows us to cover up our part

00:11:13.270 --> 00:11:16.310
in our strike against Eight Fingers,
which you instructed us to do.

00:11:16.900 --> 00:11:21.320
Now that you mention it, you said
that your goal was to recover an item.

00:11:21.320 --> 00:11:22.780
Please have a look at this.

00:11:23.240 --> 00:11:27.870
The magic imparted within this treasure
is the tenth tier magic,

00:11:27.870 --> 00:11:29.790
"Armageddon Evil."

00:11:29.790 --> 00:11:32.570
A spell to summon a large number of demons.

00:11:33.250 --> 00:11:38.300
This is an item created by Lord Ulbert.
Should we use it here?

00:11:38.420 --> 00:11:39.210
Hmm...

00:11:40.510 --> 00:11:43.300
Demiurge, you may use this.

00:11:44.010 --> 00:11:47.680
It is also an item that was created by Ulbert.

00:11:47.680 --> 00:11:50.180
It's a prototype,
but it should do, all the same.

00:11:50.180 --> 00:11:53.690
L-Lord Ains, I couldn't possibly
use your own personal object!

00:11:53.690 --> 00:11:57.190
Oh, no? Then I will give it to you, Demiurge.

00:11:57.190 --> 00:11:59.320
However, Ulbert might feel self-conscious

00:11:59.320 --> 00:12:03.950
that his failed creation
has remained around for so long.

00:12:04.530 --> 00:12:05.950
Such a...

00:12:07.910 --> 00:12:09.240
I am most grateful.

00:12:09.240 --> 00:12:14.000
Stop that, Demiurge.
Consider it a thanks for your loyalty.

00:12:14.500 --> 00:12:18.340
We guardians were created
by the Great Ones.

00:12:18.340 --> 00:12:21.760
It is only right that we demonstrate
the utmost loyalty until we perish.

00:12:22.090 --> 00:12:26.010
Nonetheless, for you to once again
address me with such charity,

00:12:26.390 --> 00:12:29.060
not to mention grant me
with a reward such a this...!

00:12:29.850 --> 00:12:34.770
I, Demiurge, humbly offer you
even deeper devotion!

00:12:34.770 --> 00:12:38.360
Uh, mm-hmm. I look forward to it.

00:12:38.360 --> 00:12:42.030
So, Demiurge, there's something more
you want to tell me, right?

00:12:42.240 --> 00:12:44.410
Yes, my lord. With that narrative in place,

00:12:44.410 --> 00:12:48.080
Jaldabaoth has attacked
the Eight Fingers bases looking for this,

00:12:48.080 --> 00:12:51.510
which ended up with him
seizing the capital's warehouse district.

00:12:52.040 --> 00:12:55.250
And of course, this item
will be found in the warehouse

00:12:55.250 --> 00:12:58.200
that serves as Eight Fingers' base,
all according to plan.

00:12:58.630 --> 00:13:01.050
So then, what is the third merit?

00:13:01.260 --> 00:13:05.800
Right. We have captured the humans
on the inside of the wall of flame.

00:13:06.140 --> 00:13:08.550
The majority of them are already
being taken away to Nazarick,

00:13:08.550 --> 00:13:11.810
where I was thinking that
they could be put to all kinds of uses.

00:13:12.220 --> 00:13:15.530
Regardless of their age
or gender, am I right?

00:13:15.850 --> 00:13:16.560
Yes.

00:13:17.230 --> 00:13:19.320
It's true, ever since I ended up in this body,

00:13:19.320 --> 00:13:22.150
I haven't felt a sense of affinity
for the human race.

00:13:22.150 --> 00:13:25.950
No matter how many we kill,
it hasn't pained my heart,

00:13:25.950 --> 00:13:29.990
so long as it benefited Nazarick.
Still, even so...

00:13:30.740 --> 00:13:35.210
Demiurge, see that those who do not
dishonor the Great Tomb of Nazarick,

00:13:35.210 --> 00:13:39.080
nor myself, are given deaths that are
without pain and suffering.

00:13:39.540 --> 00:13:43.340
How benevolent of you!
It shall be as you wish.

00:13:43.920 --> 00:13:47.840
Back to the subject at hand.
What does that leave as the fourth merit?

00:13:48.050 --> 00:13:53.350
Right. I will pin all of the ill repute
upon the demon Jaldabaoth.

00:13:53.720 --> 00:13:57.770
In other words, your goal is to
establish yourself as a notorious demon.

00:13:58.600 --> 00:14:02.010
He's using this to increase the fame
of the adventurer Momon.

00:14:03.360 --> 00:14:05.370
That makes sense. I'm convinced.

00:14:05.990 --> 00:14:09.010
So then, is there anything
you want me to cooperate with you on?

00:14:09.780 --> 00:14:13.490
All you need to do now is drive me off,
and there should be no problem.

00:14:14.080 --> 00:14:16.410
I would like to do
everything within my power

00:14:16.410 --> 00:14:19.420
to serve as your foil, Lord Ains.

00:14:25.130 --> 00:14:30.010
Wow, that little girl out there
is pretty good, huh? What was her name?

00:14:30.140 --> 00:14:33.970
I don't know; I have no interest
in these gnats' names.

00:14:33.970 --> 00:14:36.850
I believe she is Evileye of the Blue Rose.

00:14:36.850 --> 00:14:39.730
She was listed in the information
that Lord Sebas collected.

00:14:39.730 --> 00:14:41.610
Oh, so that's her name.

00:14:41.610 --> 00:14:44.440
Hey Na, are you sure your mind
isn't just starting to go?

00:14:44.440 --> 00:14:47.030
Can the rest of you remember
the names of humans?

00:14:47.030 --> 00:14:51.410
No problem for me.
I pay close attention to proper names.

00:14:51.410 --> 00:14:55.530
No worries. Actually, I get along
pretty well with humans.

00:14:56.000 --> 00:14:57.790
Not a problem.

00:15:01.790 --> 00:15:05.670
There's an earthquake.
It looks like one of Mare's.

00:15:05.670 --> 00:15:07.300
Is this some kind of sign?

00:15:07.510 --> 00:15:11.470
That's right. Okay, Narberal,
it's time for you to assume some injuries.

00:15:11.470 --> 00:15:15.180
I want to make it as painless as possible.
I hope you'll forgive me.

00:15:15.430 --> 00:15:18.180
What other choice is there? This is our job.

00:15:21.690 --> 00:15:24.170
The devil! This is the devil's doing!

00:15:24.730 --> 00:15:27.190
Stay calm! Please stay calm!

00:15:27.280 --> 00:15:30.030
--Help me! My child isn't here!
--My wife was taken away!

00:15:30.030 --> 00:15:32.910
--Where is my child? He's only three!
--Papa! Mama!

00:15:32.910 --> 00:15:36.200
Tch, it's just as the princess said.

00:15:36.200 --> 00:15:39.790
Sure enough, they split up
the families when they took them.

00:15:57.330 --> 00:15:58.600
Can you still fight?

00:15:58.600 --> 00:16:00.430
Of course. No problem.

00:16:15.950 --> 00:16:17.200
Lord Momon!

00:16:17.200 --> 00:16:22.330
That was just a little bit fun.
How can I describe it? Real?

00:16:22.330 --> 00:16:24.440
It feels like I'm actually getting to fight.

00:16:26.420 --> 00:16:28.590
I am pleased to hear it.

00:16:29.230 --> 00:16:31.090
Now, I will start fighting in earnest.

00:16:31.510 --> 00:16:34.090
Come at me, Jaldabaoth!

00:16:49.820 --> 00:16:52.530
Aspect of the Devil: Hellfire Mantle!

00:17:04.080 --> 00:17:09.210
To be melting a weapon of this level,
you must have boosted your power.

00:17:09.500 --> 00:17:11.210
Right you are.

00:17:13.420 --> 00:17:14.680
The flames of hell?!

00:17:15.380 --> 00:17:19.970
Yes. Even if you possess
a perfect resistance against flame,

00:17:19.970 --> 00:17:22.470
you will not come away
unharmed from this.

00:17:23.770 --> 00:17:25.280
Frost Pain Modified!

00:17:26.690 --> 00:17:30.480
What exactly is that?
It's much like that spear you used earlier.

00:17:31.360 --> 00:17:35.250
Icy Burst!

00:17:41.870 --> 00:17:44.250
You truly are strong.

00:17:45.160 --> 00:17:46.380
As are you.

00:17:47.290 --> 00:17:48.990
What a pair these two are...

00:17:49.670 --> 00:17:51.500
I have a proposal for you.

00:17:53.590 --> 00:17:57.760
I will be withdrawing now.
Shall we call this the end of our battle?

00:17:58.010 --> 00:17:58.890
Don't be ridiculous!

00:17:58.890 --> 00:18:00.010
Very well.

00:18:01.010 --> 00:18:03.770
I cannot surmise why
you would have brought a woman

00:18:03.770 --> 00:18:07.270
as unintelligent as her
with you, Mr. Momon.

00:18:07.650 --> 00:18:10.270
If you'd just think for a moment,
I'm sure you'll understand.

00:18:10.650 --> 00:18:15.780
I have my demon hordes standing by
to assault the whole capital at any time.

00:18:16.450 --> 00:18:19.280
You'd take... the capital hostage?

00:18:19.870 --> 00:18:23.330
Now then, we will make our retreat.

00:18:23.330 --> 00:18:28.270
Unfortunately, without recovering
the item that was our goal.

00:18:30.080 --> 00:18:31.180
They're gone.

00:18:35.550 --> 00:18:39.340
You did it! You won!
Leave it to you, Lord Momon!

00:18:39.340 --> 00:18:41.770
Er, excuse me,
but could you give me some space?

00:18:42.720 --> 00:18:44.600
You don't have to be bashful.

00:18:44.600 --> 00:18:45.680
Hey!

00:18:46.020 --> 00:18:47.480
You still alive?

00:18:48.980 --> 00:18:50.130
Guys...

00:18:50.650 --> 00:18:53.000
Lord Momon, declare victory to the others!

00:18:53.270 --> 00:18:54.440
I'd be too embarrassed.

00:18:54.920 --> 00:18:59.200
This is something that he who is
most distinguished in battle must do!

00:18:59.530 --> 00:19:02.610
Ah, I suppose you're right.
It should be done.

00:19:04.490 --> 00:19:06.200
Lord Momon is victorious!

00:19:12.630 --> 00:19:16.050
You really are going back to E-Rantel?

00:19:16.050 --> 00:19:18.220
I'd very much like to accompany you, but...

00:19:18.220 --> 00:19:19.330
Don't worry about it.

00:19:19.720 --> 00:19:22.330
You have done us an extremely great service.

00:19:22.330 --> 00:19:24.180
--Mm-hmm.
--I understand His Majesty would have
liked to thank you personally.

00:19:24.180 --> 00:19:27.250
--I understand His Majesty would have
liked to thank you personally.

00:19:27.980 --> 00:19:31.940
That's quite all right, Marquis Raeven.
I am grateful for all you've done.

00:19:32.150 --> 00:19:36.150
Not at all. I hope that we can continue
our good relations moving forward.

00:19:36.150 --> 00:19:40.490
Members of the Blue Rose,
as a fellow adamantite class adventurer,

00:19:40.490 --> 00:19:42.820
I hope I can look to you
the next time something comes up.

00:19:42.820 --> 00:19:43.770
As do we.

00:19:44.370 --> 00:19:45.270
Very well then...

00:19:49.870 --> 00:19:51.120
He turned you down, huh?

00:19:54.040 --> 00:19:55.160
No, he didn't.

00:19:56.350 --> 00:19:58.310
That's just the kind of man he is.

00:20:02.300 --> 00:20:06.890
As of now, you will all
become servants of our master.

00:20:06.890 --> 00:20:08.640
Allow us to congratulate you.

00:20:08.930 --> 00:20:10.520
D-Don't be absurd!

00:20:10.730 --> 00:20:14.190
We will begin by inviting you
to a fun new place.

00:20:14.190 --> 00:20:16.270
Yes, um, you are invited.

00:20:16.270 --> 00:20:18.070
W-Wait!

00:20:18.070 --> 00:20:18.900
Hilma...!

00:20:19.190 --> 00:20:22.360
You don't mean me, do you?
I helped you, didn't I?

00:20:22.360 --> 00:20:24.780
I've had it! I can't take any more of that!

00:20:24.990 --> 00:20:26.910
Uh, what did you do to her?

00:20:26.910 --> 00:20:31.850
I-I took her into Kyouhukou's room,
and had him eat her from the inside out.

00:20:32.320 --> 00:20:36.130
Oh, that figures. And then her wounds
were cured with healing magic.

00:20:36.130 --> 00:20:38.550
It's only natural that she'd be more submissive.

00:20:38.920 --> 00:20:42.130
Okay, lady, we need you to
buy some time with the others

00:20:42.130 --> 00:20:44.590
until we're sure they will obey us.
Can you do that?

00:20:44.590 --> 00:20:47.600
O-Of course I can! Just leave them to me!

00:20:47.600 --> 00:20:49.310
Why, you... You wouldn't!

00:20:49.720 --> 00:20:53.810
Okay then, we've taken over
half the country now.

00:20:55.020 --> 00:20:59.570
All those under your protection wish to
express their gratitude, Princess Renner.

00:20:59.570 --> 00:21:02.190
My, I would sure like to see them.

00:21:02.190 --> 00:21:07.200
You mustn't! I am so sorry
to decline your kind feelings, but...

00:21:08.910 --> 00:21:11.100
Well, I suppose that's that, then.

00:21:14.250 --> 00:21:17.080
Oh, yeah? You got beaten by Rigrit, too, huh?

00:21:17.080 --> 00:21:18.710
--Buzz off.
--She got hurt bad.

00:21:18.710 --> 00:21:19.800
And left in tears.

00:21:20.920 --> 00:21:22.300
This sure takes me back.

00:21:22.590 --> 00:21:26.050
Don't lump me in with you!
In addition to that old lady,

00:21:26.050 --> 00:21:27.550
I had all of these guys around!

00:21:27.550 --> 00:21:28.800
Come to think of it,

00:21:28.800 --> 00:21:33.270
Evileye, you can teleport, right?
You could have created a portal to E-Rantel,

00:21:33.270 --> 00:21:36.810
and then been able to go with Momon
as you please, right?

00:21:37.230 --> 00:21:37.830
Oh...

00:21:38.230 --> 00:21:40.560
You didn't realize that?!

00:21:45.320 --> 00:21:48.820
This is the new maid that has joined Nazarick.

00:21:49.070 --> 00:21:52.330
I'm Tuareninya. It is a pleasure to meet you.

00:21:52.750 --> 00:21:56.830
How much would you like her
to be able to do, woof?

00:21:57.080 --> 00:22:01.840
Please make your objective getting her
a passing grade as one of Nazarick's maids.

00:22:01.840 --> 00:22:04.920
Although, since she is only human,

00:22:04.920 --> 00:22:08.010
please keep her training
geared with that in mind.

00:22:08.800 --> 00:22:13.060
I understand, woof. Being a maid
is simply a temporary assignment, then.

00:22:13.180 --> 00:22:15.170
What do you mean by that?

00:22:15.640 --> 00:22:19.160
Only that she will be quitting
once she's married. Er, woof.

00:22:39.250 --> 00:22:40.800
Welcome back,

00:22:41.920 --> 00:22:43.170
Lord Ains!

00:22:50.010 --> 00:22:54.640
I have checked into this man
named Ains Ooal Gown.

00:22:55.140 --> 00:22:58.060
If this man truly exists,

00:22:58.060 --> 00:23:03.880
he could use magic of my caliber,
or perhaps even greater.

00:23:04.820 --> 00:23:08.930
I see. Is that why you are so pleased, old man?

00:23:10.030 --> 00:23:11.540
Naturally.

00:23:12.260 --> 00:23:17.520
It takes all sorts of oracles
to peer into the magical abyss.

00:23:18.580 --> 00:23:21.920
If possible, I'd like to meet him personally.

00:23:22.380 --> 00:23:25.090
I would also like you to collect information

00:23:25.090 --> 00:23:28.920
on an adamantite class adventurer
known as the raven-black Momon.

00:23:29.630 --> 00:23:32.430
Will you help me with that, old man?

00:23:32.890 --> 00:23:35.990
Of course I will, Your Majesty.
